=== Feed my sheep
# from 2329
--- Lovest thou me?
lead: Yes they were saved, yes they knew they had salvation, and yet when left to their own devices, Peter and the others returned to their old ways. Gone a fishing.
scripture: John 21:15-17 | mark: lovest thou me; Feed my sheep
p: This is the direction given to all saved believers. To share the Gospel and win the souls of those lost sheep. *Follow thou me.*

# from 6416, 10503
--- Walk in the Spirit [title]
overline: The walk
heading: Walk in the Spirit
big: Romans 12:1-2 | mark: be ye transformed by the renewing of your mind
center: We are washed in His blood, we are sanctified in the Spirit, and we are made new daily, by our walk with Christ.

